            <h3>Background</h3>
            <y-text id="rtpv">
                <p>Jan leaps between the high oak platforms and rope bridges of Fernwater Hollow, lifting purses and lifting spirits in equal measure. She steals mostly from the smug and the overstuffed, and has a strict personal rule against taking anything from anyone who looks hungry.</p>
            </y-text>
